 "status": "operational", "created_at": "2025-04-08T13:42:25.784Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T05:30:44.821Z", "position": 38, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": "2025-04-08", "group_id": "kb0cf2d0rryb", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}, {"id": "qks0rqykcp34", "name": "FR-MRS (Marseille)", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2025-04-08T13:43:42.266Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T05:30:45.455Z", "position": 39, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": "2025-04-08", "group_id": "kb0cf2d0rryb", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}, {"id": "kzl6jczkb2tk", "name": "MX-QRO (Queretaro)", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2025-04-08T13:44:50.559Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T05:30:46.696Z", "position": 40, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": "2025-04-08", "group_id": "kb0cf2d0rryb", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}, {"id": "3rsd4fh24z48", "name": "CL-SCL (Santiago)", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2025-04-08T13:45:05.933Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T05:30:47.679Z", "position": 41, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": "2025-04-08", "group_id": "kb0cf2d0rryb", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}, {"id": "gbwj4lm4196m", "name": "FR-PAR-2 (Paris 2)", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2026-01-06T15:34:24.715Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T05:30:48.666Z", "position": 42, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": "2026-01-06", "group_id": "kb0cf2d0rryb", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}, {"id": "x1293sz7zyff", "name": "US-IAD-2 (Washington 2)", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2026-05-05T19:15:39.919Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T05:30:49.359Z", "position": 43, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": "2026-05-05", "group_id": "kb0cf2d0rryb", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}], "reminder_intervals": null}, {"id": "fsgmc1p06swx", "name": "Emerging Service Issue - [DNS] - [eu-west]", "status": "postmortem", "created_at": "2026-09-21T16:50:00.661Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T17:46:09.378Z", "monitoring_at": "2026-09-21T22:06:39.000Z", "resolved_at": "2026-09-22T00:04:44.303Z", "impact": "none", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/t9b0j7w4wjdy", "started_at": "2026-09-21T16:50:00.652Z", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "incident_updates": [{"id": "nm7zm4v8d514", "status": "postmortem", "body": "On September 21, 2026, starting at approximately 16:10 UTC, Akamai observed degraded DNS resolution performance affecting a subset of Linode instances within the London \\(`LON1`\\) region. Platform-wide DNS resolution remained functional, and no other regions were affected.\n\nThe disruption occurred during a drive transplant of a compute host at the London \\(lon1\\) data center, which temporarily took a customer-facing DNS resolver offline. Due to a software logic flaw, customer workload configurations deployed in the last year across the region were disproportionately reliant on this single resolver, causing DNS failures when it became unavailable.\n\nAt 21:45 UTC, engineering teams deployed an emergency configuration update to rebalance and reorder active DNS resolver assignments in the region, returning DNS query performance to baseline levels. Post-remediation monitoring confirmed stable operations across `LON1`. \n\nLong-term engineering updates are currently being deployed to ensure provisioning utilities dynamically assign distinct, active DNS resolvers across all regions to prevent recurrence.\n\nThis summary reflects our current understanding of the incident based on available details. Our investigation remains ongoing, and findings may be updated as further information is reviewed.", "incident_id": "fsgmc1p06swx", "created_at": "2026-09-24T17:45:09.142Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T17:46:09.375Z", "display_at": null, "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": "We published a postmortem on our September 21st incident: https://stspg.io/t9b0j7w4wjdy", "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "l2s3x05s3njr", "status": "resolved", "body": "This incident has been resolved.", "incident_id": "fsgmc1p06swx", "created_at": "2026-09-22T00:04:44.303Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-22T00:04:44.303Z", "display_at": "2026-09-22T00:04:44.303Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "mmgkdgcjgnbl", "name": "Hosted DNS Service", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "f5p52zn7r37m", "status": "monitoring", "body": "At this time 21:45 UTC September 21st, 2026 we have been able to correct the issue affecting our DNS service in the London 1 (EU-West) region. We will be monitoring this to ensure that connectivity remains stable. Customers can apply this fix by enabling Network Helper (https://techdocs.akamai.com/cloud-computing/docs/automatically-configure-networking) and rebooting the effected Linode or please <a href=\"https://cloud.linode.com/support/tickets\">open a ticket</a> with our Support Team.", "incident_id": "fsgmc1p06swx", "created_at": "2026-09-21T22:06:39.312Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-21T22:08:36.958Z", "display_at": "2026-09-21T22:06:39.000Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "mmgkdgcjgnbl", "name": "Hosted DNS Service", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "bvr9f068pqfx", "status": "identified", "body": "We are continuing to work on a fix for this issue.", "incident_id": "fsgmc1p06swx", "created_at": "2026-09-21T21:15:18.470Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-21T21:15:18.470Z", "display_at": "2026-09-21T21:15:18.470Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "mmgkdgcjgnbl", "name": "Hosted DNS Service", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "dpk1xl6grwvq", "status": "identified", "body": "We are continuing to work on a fix for this issue.", "incident_id": "fsgmc1p06swx", "created_at": "2026-09-21T20:07:13.155Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-21T20:07:13.155Z", "display_at": "2026-09-21T20:07:13.155Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "mmgkdgcjgnbl", "name": "Hosted DNS Service", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "cp71kh66rfkv", "status": "identified", "body": "Our team has identified the issue affecting our DNS service in the London 1 (EU-West) region. We are working quickly to implement a fix, and we will provide an update as soon as the solution is in place.", "incident_id": "fsgmc1p06swx", "created_at": "2026-09-21T18:41:33.865Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-21T18:41:33.865Z", "display_at": "2026-09-21T18:41:33.865Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "mmgkdgcjgnbl", "name": "Hosted DNS Service", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "l8g8jkr0px88", "status": "investigating", "body": "Our team is investigating an emerging service issue affecting our DNS service in the London 1 (EU-West) region. We will share additional updates as we have more information.", "incident_id": "fsgmc1p06swx", "created_at": "2026-09-21T16:50:00.712Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-21T16:50:00.712Z", "display_at": "2026-09-21T16:50:00.712Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "jzjmxld11n92", "name": "Regions - EU-West (London)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}], "components": [{"id": "mmgkdgcjgnbl", "name": "Hosted DNS Service", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2016-01-04T18:48:11.136Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-24T18:26:58.528Z", "position": 3, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": null, "group_id": null, "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}], "reminder_intervals": null}, {"id": "d3tb66xbqmvh", "name": "Service Issue - Cloud Manager and API", "status": "postmortem", "created_at": "2026-09-07T10:38:14.593Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-08T09:26:33.344Z", "monitoring_at": "2026-09-07T13:27:52.861Z", "resolved_at": "2026-09-07T13:31:02.277Z", "impact": "minor", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/s7m13yr0g1g3", "started_at": "2026-09-07T10:38:14.586Z", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "incident_updates": [{"id": "ktw8x2vms0jg", "status": "postmortem", "body": "Between approximately 10:15 and 12:18 UTC on September 7, 2026, customers could have experienced elevated error rates and 5xx response codes when using Cloud Manager or performing API calls.\u00a0\n\nThe investigation revealed that the issue started due to increased API load that over-utilized our database resources which in turn led to the symptoms seen by users.\n\nTo mitigate the issue, the team addressed the elevated API load issue which brought back utilization of our resources within normal ranges. Ongoing actions include monitoring platform stability, and planning enhancements to API rate limiting.\n\nThis summary provides an overview of our current understanding of the incident given the information available. Our investigation is ongoing and any information herein is subject to change.", "incident_id": "d3tb66xbqmvh", "created_at": "2026-09-08T09:26:01.541Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-08T09:26:33.342Z", "display_at": null, "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": "We published a postmortem on our September 7th incident: https://stspg.io/s7m13yr0g1g3", "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "nxhg94vf3z17", "status": "resolved", "body": "We haven't observed any additional issues with the Cloud Manager or API, and will now consider this incident resolved. If you continue to experience issues, please contact us at 855-454-6633 (+1-609-380-7100 Intl.), or send an email to support@linode.com for assistance.", "incident_id": "d3tb66xbqmvh", "created_at": "2026-09-07T13:31:02.277Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-07T13:31:02.277Z", "display_at": "2026-09-07T13:31:02.277Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "61mfhwczrxzt", "name": "Cloud Manager and API", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "cl4qtb4xwq0r", "status": "monitoring", "body": "At this time we have been able to correct the issue affecting the Cloud Manager and API. We will be monitoring this to ensure that the service remains stable. If you are still experiencing issues and unable to <a href=\"https://cloud.linode.com/support/tickets\">open a Support ticket</a>, please call us at 855-454-6633 (+1-609-380-7100 Intl.), or send an email to support@linode.com.", "incident_id": "d3tb66xbqmvh", "created_at": "2026-09-07T13:27:52.861Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-07T13:27:52.861Z", "display_at": "2026-09-07T13:27:52.861Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "61mfhwczrxzt", "name": "Cloud Manager and API", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "x65w58cmrp1r", "status": "investigating", "body": "We are continuing to investigate this issue.", "incident_id": "d3tb66xbqmvh", "created_at": "2026-09-07T12:12:37.566Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-07T12:12:37.566Z", "display_at": "2026-09-07T12:12:37.566Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "61mfhwczrxzt", "name": "Cloud Manager and API", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "pkj7382jb3b3", "status": "investigating", "body": "We are continuing to investigate this issue.", "incident_id": "d3tb66xbqmvh", "created_at": "2026-09-07T11:39:28.633Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-07T11:39:28.633Z", "display_at": "2026-09-07T11:39:28.633Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "61mfhwczrxzt", "name": "Cloud Manager and API", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "7dmvlyb1xqdk", "status": "investigating", "body": "Our team is investigating a service issue that affects the Cloud Manager (https://cloud.linode.com/) and API. During that time, some users may experience issues when attempting to access these systems. We will share additional updates as we have more information.", "incident_id": "d3tb66xbqmvh", "created_at": "2026-09-07T10:38:14.674Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-07T10:38:14.674Z", "display_at": "2026-09-07T10:38:14.674Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "61mfhwczrxzt", "name": "Cloud Manager and API", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}], "components": [{"id": "61mfhwczrxzt", "name": "Cloud Manager and API", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2014-03-13T15:38:54.572Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-25T16:21:50.057Z", "position": 2, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": null, "group_id": null, "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}], "reminder_intervals": null}, {"id": "jddnc1lhxtg4", "name": "Service Issue - US-SEA (Seattle, WA)", "status": "postmortem", "created_at": "2026-08-28T10:26:02.985Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T20:36:57.097Z", "monitoring_at": "2026-08-28T12:45:42.237Z", "resolved_at": "2026-08-28T17:44:18.855Z", "impact": "none", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/x22zq4bd4gd9", "started_at": "2026-08-28T10:26:02.970Z", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "incident_updates": [{"id": "lz0wl76r12nx", "status": "postmortem", "body": "Between approximately 09:51 and 12:18 UTC on August 28, 2028, customers using the Seattle data center \\(US-SEA\\) were unable to provision new nodes or complete host jobs, whereas customers outside Seattle were unaffected.\u00a0\n\nThe investigation revealed that this was due to a Linux kernel issue that was triggered on a network router due to increased network traffic at this site while a specific BIOS setting was enabled.\u00a0 This caused system instability and affected job processing in the US-SEA region.\n\nTo mitigate the impact, the Akamai team disabled a problematic setting and rebooted the affected system, restoring service and moving the situation to a monitoring state by 12:18 UTC on August 28, 2026. As preventive actions, Akamai will audit hardware configurations to ensure the problematic feature is explicitly disabled, and implement enhanced monitoring to detect similar issues in the future.\u00a0\n\nThis summary provides an overview of our current understanding of the incident given the information available. Our investigation is ongoing and any information herein is subject to change.", "incident_id": "jddnc1lhxtg4", "created_at": "2026-08-28T20:36:50.618Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T20:36:57.095Z", "display_at": null, "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": "We published a postmortem on our August 28th incident: https://stspg.io/x22zq4bd4gd9", "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "9nv7pgnyv4pz", "status": "resolved", "body": "We haven't observed any additional issues with Linode control plane operations and will now consider this incident resolved. If you are still experiencing additional issues, please <a href=\"https://cloud.linode.com/support/tickets\">open a Support ticket</a> for assistance.", "incident_id": "jddnc1lhxtg4", "created_at": "2026-08-28T17:44:18.855Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T17:44:18.855Z", "display_at": "2026-08-28T17:44:18.855Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "5lw6b06mjfww", "name": "Regions - US-SEA (Seattle)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "qx710vq78w73", "name": "Linode.com", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "xzbvsvs5qv87", "status": "monitoring", "body": "We are continuing to monitor for any further issues.", "incident_id": "jddnc1lhxtg4", "created_at": "2026-08-28T12:48:25.618Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T12:48:25.618Z", "display_at": "2026-08-28T12:48:25.618Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "5lw6b06mjfww", "name": "Regions - US-SEA (Seattle)", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "qx710vq78w73", "name": "Linode.com", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": false, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "tkfl9lmprlh4", "status": "monitoring", "body": "At this time we have been able to correct the issues affecting the service. We will be monitoring this to ensure that it remains stable. If you continue to experience problems, please <a href=\"https://cloud.linode.com/support/tickets\">open a Support ticket</a> for assistance.", "incident_id": "jddnc1lhxtg4", "created_at": "2026-08-28T12:45:42.237Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T12:45:42.237Z", "display_at": "2026-08-28T12:45:42.237Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "61mfhwczrxzt", "name": "Cloud Manager and API", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "90pvlnk81nsh", "status": "investigating", "body": "Our team is investigating the issue where users may experience host unreachability, failures with all Linode control plane operations, including, but not limited to: node creation and deletion, attaching or detaching Block Storage. The issue appears to have started around 09:45 UTC on August 28, 2026. We will share additional updates as we have more information.", "incident_id": "jddnc1lhxtg4", "created_at": "2026-08-28T12:15:15.230Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T12:15:15.230Z", "display_at": "2026-08-28T12:15:15.230Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "5lw6b06mjfww", "name": "Regions - US-SEA (Seattle)", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}, {"code": "qx710vq78w73", "name": "Linode.com", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "60gtk67wzftn", "status": "investigating", "body": "We are continuing to investigate the issue. We will share additional details as soon as we have them.", "incident_id": "jddnc1lhxtg4", "created_at": "2026-08-28T11:39:53.013Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T11:39:53.013Z", "display_at": "2026-08-28T11:39:53.013Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "5lw6b06mjfww", "name": "Regions - US-SEA (Seattle)", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}, {"code": "qx710vq78w73", "name": "Linode.com", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}], "deliver_notifications": false, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "yvyc5fpkn5gp", "status": "investigating", "body": "We are investigating an emerging service issue affecting us-sea (Seattle, WA). We will share additional updates as we have more information.", "incident_id": "jddnc1lhxtg4", "created_at": "2026-08-28T10:26:03.121Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T10:26:03.121Z", "display_at": "2026-08-28T10:26:03.121Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "5lw6b06mjfww", "name": "Regions - US-SEA (Seattle)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}, {"code": "qx710vq78w73", "name": "Linode.com", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}], "components": [{"id": "qx710vq78w73", "name": "Linode.com", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2018-09-12T17:50:34.088Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T12:48:25.559Z", "position": 1, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": null, "group_id": null, "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}, {"id": "5lw6b06mjfww", "name": "US-SEA (Seattle)", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2023-09-18T18:24:26.265Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T12:48:25.580Z", "position": 16, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": "2023-09-18", "group_id": "kb0cf2d0rryb", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}], "reminder_intervals": null}, {"id": "bj7m1vbw751p", "name": "Service Issue - Object Storage - US-SEA", "status": "resolved", "created_at": "2026-08-24T21:52:45.253Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-25T01:11:13.329Z", "monitoring_at": null, "resolved_at": "2026-08-25T01:11:13.308Z", "impact": "none", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/55j87mnk3g26", "started_at": "2026-08-24T21:52:45.241Z", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "incident_updates": [{"id": "r16tnz6ysw9h", "status": "resolved", "body": "We haven\u2019t observed any additional issues with the Object Storage service, and will now consider this incident resolved. If you continue to experience problems, please <a href=\"https://cloud.linode.com/support/tickets\">open a Support ticket</a> for assistance.", "incident_id": "bj7m1vbw751p", "created_at": "2026-08-25T01:11:13.308Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-25T01:11:13.308Z", "display_at": "2026-08-25T01:11:13.308Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "gvjkvq1qzfhf", "name": "Object Storage - US-SEA (Seattle) Object Storage", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "fxjsdyf1znpg", "status": "identified", "body": "The issue has been identified and a fix is being implemented.", "incident_id": "bj7m1vbw751p", "created_at": "2026-08-25T00:55:10.987Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-25T00:55:10.987Z", "display_at": "2026-08-25T00:55:10.987Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "gvjkvq1qzfhf", "name": "Object Storage - US-SEA (Seattle) Object Storage", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "78y18b6llspt", "status": "investigating", "body": "We are continuing to investigate this issue.", "incident_id": "bj7m1vbw751p", "created_at": "2026-08-25T00:31:19.619Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-25T00:31:19.619Z", "display_at": "2026-08-25T00:31:19.619Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "gvjkvq1qzfhf", "name": "Object Storage - US-SEA (Seattle) Object Storage", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "4t854lrtwvj0", "status": "investigating", "body": "We are continuing to investigate this issue.", "incident_id": "bj7m1vbw751p", "created_at": "2026-08-24T23:11:32.131Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-24T23:11:32.131Z", "display_at": "2026-08-24T23:11:32.131Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "gvjkvq1qzfhf", "name": "Object Storage - US-SEA (Seattle) Object Storage", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "d2yj1c1zndn7", "status": "investigating", "body": "Our team is investigating an issue affecting the Object Storage service in US-SEA. During this time, users may experience intermittent 5xx errors with this service.", "incident_id": "bj7m1vbw751p", "created_at": "2026-08-24T21:52:45.311Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-24T21:52:45.311Z", "display_at": "2026-08-24T21:52:45.311Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "gvjkvq1qzfhf", "name": "Object Storage - US-SEA (Seattle) Object Storage", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}], "components": [{"id": "gvjkvq1qzfhf", "name": "US-SEA (Seattle) Object Storage", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2023-09-18T18:26:48.687Z", "updated_at": "2026-07-18T04:36:16.144Z", "position": 9, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": "2023-09-18", "group_id": "4bvp5l14grs6", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}], "reminder_intervals": null}, {"id": "n8shhnp9c0x8", "name": "Service Issue - US-SEA (Seattle, WA)", "status": "postmortem", "created_at": "2026-08-21T17:23:15.830Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-07T18:36:53.186Z", "monitoring_at": null, "resolved_at": "2026-08-21T21:59:09.975Z", "impact": "none", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/gcbmqj8l4yxn", "started_at": "2026-08-21T17:23:15.820Z", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "incident_updates": [{"id": "3bym92h4zrzr", "status": "postmortem", "body": "On August 21, 2026 starting approximately at 17:23 UTC, customers using the Seattle data center \\(US-SEA\\) were unable to provision new nodes or complete host jobs, whereas customers outside Seattle were unaffected.\u00a0\n\nThe investigation revealed that this was due to a Linux kernel issue that was triggered on a network router due to increased network traffic at this site while a specific BIOS setting was enabled.\u00a0 This caused system instability and affected job processing in the US-SEA region.\n\nTo mitigate the impact, the Akamai team disabled a problematic setting and rebooted the affected system, restoring service and moving the situation to a monitoring state by 21:59 UTC on August 21, 2026. As preventive actions, Akamai will audit hardware configurations to ensure the problematic feature is explicitly disabled, and implement enhanced monitoring to detect similar issues in the future.\u00a0\n\nThis summary provides an overview of our current understanding of the incident given the information available. Our investigation is ongoing and any information herein is subject to change.", "incident_id": "n8shhnp9c0x8", "created_at": "2026-09-07T18:36:14.280Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-07T18:36:53.184Z", "display_at": null, "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": "We published a postmortem on our August 21st incident: https://stspg.io/gcbmqj8l4yxn", "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "y6v3182vhcwr", "status": "resolved", "body": "At this time we have been able to correct the issue and the service has resumed normal operation.", "incident_id": "n8shhnp9c0x8", "created_at": "2026-08-21T21:59:09.975Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-21T21:59:09.975Z", "display_at": "2026-08-21T21:59:09.975Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "5lw6b06mjfww", "name": "Regions - US-SEA (Seattle)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "qhkw7kxhl12p", "status": "investigating", "body": "Our team is investigating an emerging service issue affecting us-sea (Seattle, WA). We will share additional updates as we have more information.", "incident_id": "n8shhnp9c0x8", "created_at": "2026-08-21T17:23:15.885Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-21T17:23:15.885Z", "display_at": "2026-08-21T17:23:15.885Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "5lw6b06mjfww", "name": "Regions - US-SEA (Seattle)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}], "components": [{"id": "5lw6b06mjfww", "name": "US-SEA (Seattle)", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2023-09-18T18:24:26.265Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-28T12:48:25.580Z", "position": 16, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": "2023-09-18", "group_id": "kb0cf2d0rryb", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}], "reminder_intervals": null}, {"id": "r67rvbmvf3hw", "name": "Upstream Issues - Ubuntu", "status": "resolved", "created_at": "2026-08-10T17:15:16.173Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-21T18:40:56.598Z", "monitoring_at": null, "resolved_at": "2026-08-21T18:40:56.582Z", "impact": "none", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/jq3jz0489mdg", "started_at": "2026-08-10T17:15:16.164Z", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "incident_updates": [{"id": "x4mzthf6m3y8", "status": "resolved", "body": "We can confirm that the issue was mitigated at 06:30 UTC on August 20, 2026 and the service has resumed normal operations.", "incident_id": "r67rvbmvf3hw", "created_at": "2026-08-21T18:40:56.582Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-21T18:40:56.582Z", "display_at": "2026-08-21T18:40:56.582Z", "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": false, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "448clvnbrkqg", "status": "identified", "body": "We have identified the cause of the issue, and a fix is being implemented. We will provide an update as soon as the solution is in place.", "incident_id": "r67rvbmvf3hw", "created_at": "2026-08-12T03:29:52.445Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-12T03:29:52.445Z", "display_at": "2026-08-12T03:29:52.445Z", "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": false, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "09m0bdz41bvd", "status": "investigating", "body": "We are continuing to investigate this issue. The appropriate subject matter experts are engaged. Subsequent updates around mitigation status will be posted as progress is made.", "incident_id": "r67rvbmvf3hw", "created_at": "2026-08-11T23:35:21.660Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-11T23:35:21.660Z", "display_at": "2026-08-11T23:35:21.660Z", "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": false, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "n8y17lgdwf7p", "status": "investigating", "body": "Our team is investigating an upstream issue impacting Ubuntu deployments. This may impact the ability to install package and security updates on all Ubuntu systems.", "incident_id": "r67rvbmvf3hw", "created_at": "2026-08-10T17:15:16.231Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-10T17:15:16.231Z", "display_at": "2026-08-10T17:15:16.231Z", "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": false, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}], "components": [], "reminder_intervals": null}, {"id": "1xk4bm1h0cmr", "name": "Connectivity Issue - IT-MIL (Milan) data center", "status": "postmortem", "created_at": "2026-08-14T20:13:30.821Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-18T19:03:25.297Z", "monitoring_at": null, "resolved_at": "2026-08-14T21:30:41.727Z", "impact": "minor", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/bvhf6n00rw42", "started_at": "2026-08-14T20:13:30.809Z", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "incident_updates": [{"id": "djjlbtbppz02", "status": "postmortem", "body": "On August 14, 2026, starting around 17:30 UTC, during an event in our IT-MIL \\(Milan\\) data center, multiple alerts were triggered indicating that multiple hosts in this data center became unreachable.\n\n\u200c\n\nAkamai immediately began investigating the issue and working to restore the impacted hosts. During the impact window, customers would have experienced intermittent connection timeouts and errors across all services deployed in this data center.\n\n\u200c\n\nWe restored the impacted hosts and fixed the connectivity issues at 21:20 UTC on August 14, 2026. We are still investigating the cause of the failure condition.\n\n\u200c\n\nWe are committed to preventing future incidents and will conduct a thorough investigation into why the hosts became unreachable, implementing measures to enhance stability and reliability.\n\n\u200c\n\nThis summary provides an overview of our current understanding of the incident given the information available. Our investigation is ongoing, and any information herein is subject to change.", "incident_id": "1xk4bm1h0cmr", "created_at": "2026-08-18T19:02:57.786Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-18T19:03:25.296Z", "display_at": null, "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": "We published a postmortem on our August 14th incident: https://stspg.io/bvhf6n00rw42", "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "cy7xj2jv74p1", "status": "resolved", "body": "We haven\u2019t observed any additional connectivity issues in our  IT-MIL (Milan)  data center and will now consider this incident resolved. If you continue to experience problems, please <a href=\"https://cloud.linode.com/support/tickets\">open a Support ticket</a> for assistance.", "incident_id": "1xk4bm1h0cmr", "created_at": "2026-08-14T21:30:41.727Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-14T21:30:41.727Z", "display_at": "2026-08-14T21:30:41.727Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "97ph0y1mr35s", "name": "Regions - IT-MIL (Milan)", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "8mpj3n4f08b8", "status": "investigating", "body": "We are continuing to investigate this issue. We will share additional updates as we have more information.", "incident_id": "1xk4bm1h0cmr", "created_at": "2026-08-14T21:18:10.920Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-14T21:18:10.920Z", "display_at": "2026-08-14T21:18:10.920Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "97ph0y1mr35s", "name": "Regions - IT-MIL (Milan)", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "ng8rpsgz77t5", "status": "investigating", "body": "Our team is investigating an issue affecting connectivity in our IT-MIL (Milan) data center. During this time, users may experience intermittent connection timeouts and errors for all services deployed in this data center. We will share additional updates as we have more information.", "incident_id": "1xk4bm1h0cmr", "created_at": "2026-08-14T20:13:30.922Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-14T20:13:30.922Z", "display_at": "2026-08-14T20:13:30.922Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "97ph0y1mr35s", "name": "Regions - IT-MIL (Milan)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}], "components": [{"id": "97ph0y1mr35s", "name": "IT-MIL (Milan)", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2023-09-21T16:28:54.027Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-19T05:30:26.450Z", "position": 17, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": "2023-09-21", "group_id": "kb0cf2d0rryb", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}], "reminder_intervals": null}, {"id": "ldvz7stfxtsg", "name": "Emerging Service Issue - API - All Regions", "status": "postmortem", "created_at": "2026-08-13T18:46:25.112Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-17T17:39:07.755Z", "monitoring_at": "2026-08-13T19:58:22.358Z", "resolved_at": "2026-08-14T00:26:48.647Z", "impact": "none", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/qwq3924zp5zr", "started_at": "2026-08-13T18:46:25.047Z", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "incident_updates": [{"id": "5wxphwwpmc7s", "status": "postmortem", "body": "On August 13th, 2026, at approximately 18:15 UTC, Akamai observed a brief service outage affecting [_api.linode.com_](http://api.linode.com). The total service interruption lasted for approximately 3 minutes, concluding at 18:18 UTC. Following the restoration of initial connectivity, elevated API response latency persisted through 19:06 UTC, causing slower response times and intermittent delays for customers interacting with API services.\n\nTo address the performance impact, Akamai engineering teams identified a configuration discrepancy on the secondary caching infrastructure node that prevented it from absorbing the full traffic load after the failover. Engineers completed a controlled migration and moved request caching traffic back over to the primary host. Following this change, API latency rapidly decreased to normal operational levels.\n\nThe initial condition was triggered by an unexpected reboot of the primary caching node's physical host. While redundant infrastructure was active, the secondary node was unable to process the failover traffic seamlessly, causing the extended performance degradation.\n\nOur engineering teams are conducting a follow-up investigation into the failover mechanisms to optimize execution speeds and align configuration settings across redundant nodes, ensuring secondary systems can handle traffic seamlessly in future events.\n\nThis summary provides an overview of our current understanding of the incident given the information available. Our investigation is ongoing and any information herein is subject to change.", "incident_id": "ldvz7stfxtsg", "created_at": "2026-08-17T17:38:50.468Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-17T17:39:07.750Z", "display_at": null, "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": "We published a postmortem on our August 13th incident: https://stspg.io/qwq3924zp5zr", "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "jsyjpd6hqxjj", "status": "resolved", "body": "This incident has been resolved.", "incident_id": "ldvz7stfxtsg", "created_at": "2026-08-14T00:26:48.647Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-14T00:26:48.647Z", "display_at": "2026-08-14T00:26:48.647Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "61mfhwczrxzt", "name": "Cloud Manager and API", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "tcrzhfsqnv7h", "status": "monitoring", "body": "We are continuing to monitor for any further issues.", "incident_id": "ldvz7stfxtsg", "created_at": "2026-08-13T19:59:17.757Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-13T19:59:17.757Z", "display_at": "2026-08-13T19:59:17.757Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "61mfhwczrxzt", "name": "Cloud Manager and API", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "z36vsy62km5q", "status": "monitoring", "body": "As of 19:30 UTC have been able to correct the issue affecting API in all regions. We will be monitoring this to ensure that the service remains stable. If you are still experiencing issues and unable to <a href=\"https://cloud.linode.com/support/tickets\">open a Support ticket</a>, please call us at 855-454-6633 (+1-609-380-7100 Intl.), or send an email to support@linode.com.", "incident_id": "ldvz7stfxtsg", "created_at": "2026-08-13T19:58:22.358Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-13T19:58:22.358Z", "display_at": "2026-08-13T19:58:22.358Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "61mfhwczrxzt", "name": "Cloud Manager and API", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "wznqqk521nxd", "status": "investigating", "body": "Our team is investigating an emerging service issue affecting the API in all regions. We will share additional updates as we have more information.", "incident_id": "ldvz7stfxtsg", "created_at": "2026-08-13T18:46:25.248Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-13T18:46:25.248Z", "display_at": "2026-08-13T18:46:25.248Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "61mfhwczrxzt", "name": "Cloud Manager and API", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "v8zpnn61fcdm", "name": "Regions - US-East (Newark)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "s8355f9s5hpx", "name": "Regions - US-Central (Dallas)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "v5mcdxdt9dtv", "name": "Regions - US-West (Fremont)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "ss2n92gy5xkk", "name": "Regions - US-Southeast (Atlanta)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "h9sk1q74fyb6", "name": "Regions - US-IAD (Washington)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "43zk807gj6fx", "name": "Regions - US-ORD (Chicago)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "ptln4fx0jhrt", "name": "Regions - CA-Central (Toronto)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "jzjmxld11n92", "name": "Regions - EU-West (London)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "bxcfhjdf5c4k", "name": "Regions - EU-Central (Frankfurt)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "19fvt94q0t57", "name": "Regions - FR-PAR (Paris)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "ymhgjx06c93n", "name": "Regions - AP-South (Singapore)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "94q3fkblbvs3", "name": "Regions - AP-Northeast-2 (Tokyo 2)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "cc7n9z4yz3gw", "name": "Regions - AP-West (Mumbai)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "lq833jghn099", "name": "Regions - AP-Southeast (Sydney)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "4z9p9xqmgydl", "name": "Regions - SE-STO (Stockholm)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "5lw6b06mjfww", "name": "Regions - US-SEA (Seattle)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "97ph0y1mr35s", "name": "Regions - IT-MIL (Milan)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "78r1m3zx96gz", "name": "Regions - JP-OSA (Osaka)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "k0thr1zd6smm", "name": "Regions - IN-MAA (Chennai)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "knknlr4ljq5l", "name": "Regions - ID-CGK (Jakarta)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "zwpwqtzrsl8k", "name": "Regions - BR-GRU (S\u00e3o Paulo)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "8w3v0zhrbx3z", "name": "Regions - NL-AMS (Amsterdam)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "pkd875v4jmzl", "name": "Regions - US-MIA (Miami)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "7xrbxwctvj1h", "name": "Regions - US-LAX (Los Angeles)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "vvf30fxrnjkq", "name": "Regions - ES-MAD (Madrid)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "2nv8wdb0yh73", "name": "Regions - AU-MEL (Melbourne)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "105zz4c1sxhy", "name": "Regions - GB-LON (London 2)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "8xrfbhs3qrxq", "name": "Regions - IN-BOM-2 (Mumbai 2)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "wv0j73xx50p7", "name": "Regions - SG-SIN-2 (Singapore 2)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "hb72slbdqdk0", "name": "Regions - DE-FRA-2 (Frankfurt 2)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "cnf3qw9p4v9v", "name": "Regions - JP-TYO-3 (Tokyo 3)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "tfkm2rdwyj30", "name": "Regions - ZA-JNB (Johannesburg)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "h36d0drvbkft", "name": "Regions - NZ-AKL (Auckland)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "9b6chx87y28w", "name": "Regions - CO-BOG (Bogota)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "2vzdgh6ysfzz", "name": "Regions - US-DEN (Denver)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "9qsy3z48wlm7", "name": "Regions - DE-HAM (Hamburg)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "4j2hqzkcb5bw", "name": "Regions - US-HOU (Houston)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "z8lp5jw3mjpb", "name": "Regions - MY-KUL (Kuala Lumpur)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "qks0rqykcp34", "name": "Regions - FR-MRS (Marseille)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "kzl6jczkb2tk", "name": "Regions - MX-QRO (Queretaro)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "3rsd4fh24z48", "name": "Regions - CL-SCL (Santiago)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "gbwj4lm4196m", "name": "Regions - FR-PAR-2 (Paris 2)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "x1293sz7zyff", "name": "Regions - US-IAD-2 (Washington 2)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}], "components": [{"id": "61mfhwczrxzt", "name": "Cloud Manager and API", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2014-03-13T15:38:54.572Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-25T16:21:50.057Z", "position": 2, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": null, "group_id": null, "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}], "reminder_intervals": null}, {"id": "tdd8x7fd156w", "name": "Service Issue - Linode Kubernetes Engine Enterprise (LKE-E)- IAD2 (Washington)", "status": "postmortem", "created_at": "2026-08-13T21:13:17.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-18T20:34:35.965Z", "monitoring_at": "2026-08-13T23:02:03.958Z", "resolved_at": "2026-08-13T23:24:56.873Z", "impact": "minor", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/80fhmqyywbpb", "started_at": "2026-08-13T21:13:17.000Z", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "incident_updates": [{"id": "0lsb5pp2fvdb", "status": "postmortem", "body": "Between 17:25 UTC and 22:50 UTC on August 13, 2026, Linode Kubernetes Engine Enterprise \\(LKE-E\\) customers attempting to deploy G7 dedicated Linode instances in our Washington \\(IAD2\\) data center, received 403 provisioning error messages. Active workloads and running instances were not affected by this issue.\n\nOur investigation revealed that while total physical hardware capacity in IAD2 was sufficient, the provisioning request triggered an entitlement check failure due to an initial soft host-allocation threshold.\n\nAkamai resolved the issue by increasing the Linode-per-host limit from 5 to 20 in IAD2. Full deployment capabilities were restored and stabilized at 22:50 UTC.\n\nTo prevent recurrence moving forward, we will implement dedicated alerting for entitlement and capacity issues, directly linked to response runbooks for rapid remediation. Additionally, we are building a centralized capacity overview dashboard to proactively track regional headroom.\n\nThis summary provides an overview of our current understanding of the incident given the information available. Our investigation is ongoing and any information herein is subject to change.", "incident_id": "tdd8x7fd156w", "created_at": "2026-08-18T20:32:11.632Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-18T20:34:35.963Z", "display_at": null, "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": "We published a postmortem on our August 13th incident: https://stspg.io/80fhmqyywbpb", "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "wsnkkgbvwdjp", "status": "resolved", "body": "This incident has been resolved.", "incident_id": "tdd8x7fd156w", "created_at": "2026-08-13T23:24:56.873Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-13T23:24:56.873Z", "display_at": "2026-08-13T23:24:56.873Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "x1cq6rjcpsm1", "name": "Linode Kubernetes Engine - US-IAD (Washington) Linode Kubernetes Engine", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "2dvtkmvxpq5j", "status": "monitoring", "body": "A fix has been implemented and we are monitoring the results.", "incident_id": "tdd8x7fd156w", "created_at": "2026-08-13T23:02:03.958Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-13T23:02:03.958Z", "display_at": "2026-08-13T23:02:03.958Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "x1cq6rjcpsm1", "name": "Linode Kubernetes Engine - US-IAD (Washington) Linode Kubernetes Engine", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "0hm9yf7hk4kv", "status": "investigating", "body": "Our team is investigating an issue affecting creation of Linode Kubernetes Engine Enterprise (LKE-E) clusters in the IAD2 - Washington data center. This is a continuation of the issue reported earlier. We will share additional updates as we have more information.", "incident_id": "tdd8x7fd156w", "created_at": "2026-08-13T21:13:17.394Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-17T20:57:43.920Z", "display_at": "2026-08-13T21:13:17.000Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "x1cq6rjcpsm1", "name": "Linode Kubernetes Engine - US-IAD (Washington) Linode Kubernetes Engine", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}], "components": [{"id": "x1cq6rjcpsm1", "name": "US-IAD (Washington) Linode Kubernetes Engine", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2023-07-05T17:53:16.887Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-13T23:24:56.840Z", "position": 5, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": "2023-07-05", "group_id": "lplvcng25jv0", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}], "reminder_intervals": null}, {"id": "qs8jdh61tyr3", "name": "Service Issue - Linode Kubernetes Engine (IAD2)", "status": "postmortem", "created_at": "2026-08-13T16:16:27.212Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-17T21:30:43.296Z", "monitoring_at": "2026-08-13T16:30:56.867Z", "resolved_at": "2026-08-13T17:54:10.365Z", "impact": "minor", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/tq334j0j3tzz", "started_at": "2026-08-13T16:16:27.203Z", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "incident_updates": [{"id": "r00cgy8bgfqj", "status": "postmortem", "body": "Beginning at approximately 14:50 UTC on August 13, 2026, customers who attempted to provision Linode Kubernetes Engine Enterprise \\(LKE-E\\) clusters in the IAD2 data center were unable to. We identified that the issue was due to the exclusion of two components in IAD2 in a recent software version upgrade which resulted in an API mismatch.\n\nWe updated the identified components to bring them in sync with the expected state. This mitigated the issue at approximately 16:00 UTC on August 13, 2026.\n\nTo prevent this issue from occurring in the future, we are reviewing LKE software update processes to ensure that all included components complete version upgrades before being reintroduced to service during platform software updates.\n\nThis summary provides an overview of our current understanding of the incident given the information available. Our investigation is ongoing and any information herein is subject to change.", "incident_id": "qs8jdh61tyr3", "created_at": "2026-08-17T21:30:02.344Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-17T21:30:43.294Z", "display_at": null, "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": "We published a postmortem on our August 13th incident: https://stspg.io/tq334j0j3tzz", "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "r1hzxpwkmx7h", "status": "resolved", "body": "We haven\u2019t observed any additional issues with the LKE service, and will now consider this incident resolved. If you continue to experience problems, please <a href=\"https://cloud.linode.com/support/tickets\">open a Support ticket</a> for assistance.", "incident_id": "qs8jdh61tyr3", "created_at": "2026-08-13T17:54:10.365Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-13T17:54:10.365Z", "display_at": "2026-08-13T17:54:10.365Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "x1cq6rjcpsm1", "name": "Linode Kubernetes Engine - US-IAD (Washington) Linode Kubernetes Engine", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "v8pvqfs0df9r", "status": "monitoring", "body": "At this time we have been able to correct the issues affecting the LKE service. We will be monitoring this to ensure that it remains stable. If you continue to experience problems, please <a href=\"https://cloud.linode.com/support/tickets\">open a Support ticket</a> for assistance.", "incident_id": "qs8jdh61tyr3", "created_at": "2026-08-13T16:30:56.867Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-13T16:30:56.867Z", "display_at": "2026-08-13T16:30:56.867Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "x1cq6rjcpsm1", "name": "Linode Kubernetes Engine - US-IAD (Washington) Linode Kubernetes Engine", "old_status": "degraded_performance", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "1rc6rw89p9tw", "status": "investigating", "body": "Our team is investigating an issue affecting the Linode Kubernetes Engine (LKE). We will share additional updates as we have more information.", "incident_id": "qs8jdh61tyr3", "created_at": "2026-08-13T16:16:27.291Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-13T16:16:27.291Z", "display_at": "2026-08-13T16:16:27.291Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "x1cq6rjcpsm1", "name": "Linode Kubernetes Engine - US-IAD (Washington) Linode Kubernetes Engine", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "degraded_performance"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}], "components": [{"id": "x1cq6rjcpsm1", "name": "US-IAD (Washington) Linode Kubernetes Engine", "status": "operational", "created_at": "2023-07-05T17:53:16.887Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-13T23:24:56.840Z", "position": 5, "description": null, "showcase": false, "start_date": "2023-07-05", "group_id": "lplvcng25jv0", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "group": false, "only_show_if_degraded": false}], "reminder_intervals": null}, {"id": "1zbc64w8cq1w", "name": "Service Issue - Linode Kubernetes Engine Enterprise (LKE-E) - Seattle (SEA1)", "status": "postmortem", "created_at": "2026-08-13T14:00:00.000Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-21T13:13:45.844Z", "monitoring_at": null, "resolved_at": "2026-08-13T14:00:00.000Z", "impact": "none", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/ks33wr32mhq8", "started_at": "2026-08-14T15:46:34.555Z", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "incident_updates": [{"id": "50w4f8h7b48w", "status": "postmortem", "body": "On August 13, 2026, between approximately 14:30 and 16:30 UTC, Akamai experienced an issue affecting Linode Kubernetes Engine Enterprise \\(LKE-E\\) cluster provisioning and deployment in the Seattle \\(SEA1\\) region. During this time, customers attempting to create new clusters encountered failures or delays. In some cases, clusters were created but nodes were not fully provisioned, while in others, the control plane responsible for managing the cluster could not be deployed.\n\nAkamai identified the issue through customer reports, which was then validated by reproducing the failures in Seattle-based test clusters. Other regions continued to operate normally, and no existing customer workloads were impacted.\n\nBy around 16:30 UTC on August 13, 2026, cluster provisioning and deployment in the Seattle region returned to normal, allowing new cluster creations to proceed without issue. After recovery, we monitored the region for several days and began a technical investigation into the service disruption. Initial findings indicate a correlation between the issue and a recent network configuration update that occurred at approximately 14:30 UTC and was rolled back at approximately 14:45 UTC. Our current hypothesis suggests that a timing conflict during the cluster provisioning process may have triggered the failures. We are continuing to investigate the technical details to confirm the root cause.\n\nWe are continuing to investigate the technical details behind this issue and are working to ensure it does not recur. We will also review the scope of affected data centers and track corrective actions. \n\nThis summary provides an overview of our current understanding of the incident given the information available. Our investigation is ongoing and any information herein is subject to change.", "incident_id": "1zbc64w8cq1w", "created_at": "2026-08-21T13:13:28.570Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-21T13:13:45.841Z", "display_at": null, "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": "We published a postmortem on our August 14th incident: https://stspg.io/ks33wr32mhq8", "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "t6kd8vlcd26j", "status": "resolved", "body": "On August 13, 2026, between approximately 14:00-16:30 UTC, we observed intermittent failures and delays when provisioning new LKE-E clusters in the Seattle (SEA1) region. The issue affecting the LKE-E service in Seattle self-corrected at approximately 16:30 UTC, and we have not observed a recurrence since. We are actively investigating the cause. We will continue to monitor the service for stability.  If you experience any problems with this service, please <a href=\"https://cloud.linode.com/support/tickets\">open a Support ticket</a> for assistance.", "incident_id": "1zbc64w8cq1w", "created_at": "2026-08-14T15:46:34.601Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-14T15:46:34.601Z", "display_at": "2026-08-13T14:00:00.000Z", "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": false, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}], "components": [], "reminder_intervals": null}, {"id": "xbzbh7vc62jx", "name": "Upstream Loss - Some Paths (in-maa/in-bom-2 to US Region)", "status": "postmortem", "created_at": "2026-07-31T17:49:13.634Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-05T17:50:59.803Z", "monitoring_at": null, "resolved_at": "2026-08-05T01:34:34.041Z", "impact": "none", "shortlink": "https://stspg.io/hcgmt53ky14f", "started_at": "2026-07-31T17:49:13.606Z", "page_id": "8dn0wstr1chc", "incident_updates": [{"id": "gft9g9tm9ms1", "status": "postmortem", "body": "On July 31, 2026, at approximately 10:00 UTC, Akamai observed intermittent network losses affecting compute users accessing US locations from our India sites \\(MAA and BOM\\). Customers\u2019 services in North America, particularly the Miami data center region, experienced increased latency, intermittent connectivity issues, slower data transfers, and difficulty reaching certain applications or services. Performance was unstable, with periods of normal operation followed by disruptions. \n\nTo address the issue, Akamai applied a deny-all policy to the impacted upstream provider transit link, redirecting traffic around the impacted routes. Despite this mitigation, ongoing IPv6 losses occurred due to congestion between two alternative upstream providers, impacting some users. One provider acknowledged a bottleneck in the Asia region, and the alternate provider worked to reroute traffic away from affected links.\u00a0\n\nThe initial impacted service provider confirmed that two fiber cuts in Mexico caused congestion on the impacted routes. One of these fiber cuts was resolved at 23:43 UTC on July 31, 2026, and no further issues were observed following this mitigation.\u00a0\n\nThis summary provides an overview of our current understanding of the incident given the information available. Our investigation is ongoing and any information herein is subject to change.", "incident_id": "xbzbh7vc62jx", "created_at": "2026-08-05T17:49:12.475Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-05T17:50:59.801Z", "display_at": null, "affected_components": null, "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": "We published a postmortem on our July 31st incident: https://stspg.io/hcgmt53ky14f", "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "k6s50nvyhyfc", "status": "resolved", "body": "At this time the upstream provider has been able to correct the issue causing packet loss on some routes from the in-maa & in-bom-2 data centers into the US region and will now consider this incident resolved. If you continue to experience problems, please <a href=\"https://cloud.linode.com/support/tickets\">open a Support ticket</a> for assistance.", "incident_id": "xbzbh7vc62jx", "created_at": "2026-08-05T01:34:34.041Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-05T01:34:34.041Z", "display_at": "2026-08-05T01:34:34.041Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "v8zpnn61fcdm", "name": "Regions - US-East (Newark)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "s8355f9s5hpx", "name": "Regions - US-Central (Dallas)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "v5mcdxdt9dtv", "name": "Regions - US-West (Fremont)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "ss2n92gy5xkk", "name": "Regions - US-Southeast (Atlanta)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "h9sk1q74fyb6", "name": "Regions - US-IAD (Washington)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "43zk807gj6fx", "name": "Regions - US-ORD (Chicago)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "5lw6b06mjfww", "name": "Regions - US-SEA (Seattle)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "k0thr1zd6smm", "name": "Regions - IN-MAA (Chennai)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "pkd875v4jmzl", "name": "Regions - US-MIA (Miami)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "7xrbxwctvj1h", "name": "Regions - US-LAX (Los Angeles)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "8xrfbhs3qrxq", "name": "Regions - IN-BOM-2 (Mumbai 2)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "2vzdgh6ysfzz", "name": "Regions - US-DEN (Denver)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "4j2hqzkcb5bw", "name": "Regions - US-HOU (Houston)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "x1293sz7zyff", "name": "Regions - US-IAD-2 (Washington 2)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "n2h9m6ltgbpw", "status": "identified", "body": "We are continuing to work with our upstream provider to resolve the packet loss affecting some paths between the in-maa and in-bom-2 data centers and the US region. We will share further updates as progress continues.", "incident_id": "xbzbh7vc62jx", "created_at": "2026-08-04T18:36:21.339Z", "updated_at": "2026-08-04T18:36:21.339Z", "display_at": "2026-08-04T18:36:21.339Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "v8zpnn61fcdm", "name": "Regions - US-East (Newark)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "s8355f9s5hpx", "name": "Regions - US-Central (Dallas)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "v5mcdxdt9dtv", "name": "Regions - US-West (Fremont)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "ss2n92gy5xkk", "name": "Regions - US-Southeast (Atlanta)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "h9sk1q74fyb6", "name": "Regions - US-IAD (Washington)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "43zk807gj6fx", "name": "Regions - US-ORD (Chicago)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "5lw6b06mjfww", "name": "Regions - US-SEA (Seattle)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "k0thr1zd6smm", "name": "Regions - IN-MAA (Chennai)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "pkd875v4jmzl", "name": "Regions - US-MIA (Miami)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "7xrbxwctvj1h", "name": "Regions - US-LAX (Los Angeles)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "8xrfbhs3qrxq", "name": "Regions - IN-BOM-2 (Mumbai 2)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "2vzdgh6ysfzz", "name": "Regions - US-DEN (Denver)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "4j2hqzkcb5bw", "name": "Regions - US-HOU (Houston)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}, {"code": "x1293sz7zyff", "name": "Regions - US-IAD-2 (Washington 2)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "operational"}], "deliver_notifications": true, "custom_tweet": null, "tweet_id": null}, {"id": "28bh8xznf52k", "status": "identified", "body": "Our team has identified the cause of packet loss to our US data centers. We are working with our upstream provider to resolve this issue and we will provide an update as soon as the solution is in place.", "incident_id": "xbzbh7vc62jx", "created_at": "2026-07-31T18:25:33.511Z", "updated_at": "2026-07-31T18:25:33.511Z", "display_at": "2026-07-31T18:25:33.511Z", "affected_components": [{"code": "v8zpnn61fcdm", "name": "Regions - US-East (Newark)", "old_status": "operational", "new_status": "ope